WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.572 --> 00:00:04.324
(soulful music)

00:00:04.324 --> 00:00:05.177
(record scratch)

00:00:05.177 --> 00:00:07.056
- Oh, hey, Tracy.

00:00:07.871 --> 00:00:08.974
(soulful music)

00:00:08.974 --> 00:00:12.736
Things Olivia Pope does that
would be weird if you did them.

00:00:12.736 --> 00:00:13.754
- Hey Seth, what's wrong?

00:00:13.754 --> 00:00:15.946
- I just spilled water on my
computer, I think it's broken.

00:00:15.946 --> 00:00:17.261
- Okay, I need you to listen to me,

00:00:17.261 --> 00:00:19.176
listen to me closely and
follow my instructions exactly.

00:00:19.176 --> 00:00:20.720
You're gonna take this
computer to the storage closet

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:22.136
and you're gonna leave
it on the third shelf.

00:00:22.136 --> 00:00:23.610
Then, you're gonna take
this ticket to Kansas,

00:00:23.610 --> 00:00:25.131
go spend some time with your lovely mother

00:00:25.131 --> 00:00:26.733
and lay low for a month
until this all blows over.

00:00:26.733 --> 00:00:27.877
Do you understand?

00:00:27.877 --> 00:00:29.860
- My mom doesn't live in Kansas.

00:00:29.860 --> 00:00:31.725
Sustenance.

00:00:32.433 --> 00:00:33.756
- Hey guys.

00:00:36.097 --> 00:00:38.457
- Thanks for volunteering to
help clean the kitchen guys.

00:00:38.457 --> 00:00:39.840
Patrick, can you do the counter tops?

00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:42.174
- Tracy, I want you to
empty the dishwasher.

00:00:42.174 --> 00:00:43.764
- You don't get to say that!

00:00:43.764 --> 00:00:46.537
If you want me, earn me!

00:00:48.568 --> 00:00:50.381
- Guys, I've got some sad news,

00:00:50.381 --> 00:00:51.775
last night we had to let someone go,

00:00:51.775 --> 00:00:53.737
and, well, Bob will not be
working with us anymore.

00:00:53.737 --> 00:00:56.558
- No, he can't go, we
were supposed to stand

00:00:56.558 --> 00:00:58.482
in the sun together.

00:01:00.278 --> 00:01:02.426
- Tracy, tell me about this
new guy you've been dating.

00:01:02.426 --> 00:01:04.373
- Oh, my God, he is so funny, he's tall,

00:01:04.373 --> 00:01:07.357
he works out all the time,
he's married with three kids...

00:01:07.357 --> 00:01:08.683
- Wait, he's married?

00:01:08.683 --> 00:01:10.750
- He's also the President
of the United States.

00:01:10.750 --> 00:01:11.771
- The fuck?

00:01:11.771 --> 00:01:13.431
- And I'm pretty sure he killed my mama.

00:01:13.431 --> 00:01:14.244
- What?!

00:01:14.244 --> 00:01:17.063
- I love him okay and we
are gonna be together!

00:01:17.856 --> 00:01:18.929
- So, the great thing about this is that

00:01:18.929 --> 00:01:20.669
we should not be met with
a lot of defiance when it

00:01:20.669 --> 00:01:23.889
comes to submitting--
- Defiance? Did you say Defiance?

00:01:23.889 --> 00:01:24.911
Who told you about defiance?

00:01:24.911 --> 00:01:26.359
- That sweater fits you really well.

00:01:26.359 --> 00:01:27.562
- Thank you.

00:01:28.009 --> 00:01:30.088
- Fitz? Is Fitz here?

00:01:30.516 --> 00:01:33.852
- 7:52, 7:52, 7:52...

00:01:33.852 --> 00:01:35.953
- Should we call someone?

00:01:35.953 --> 00:01:37.591
- Hey, hey, excuse me,
excuse me, he's with me,

00:01:37.591 --> 00:01:39.135
he's with me, no problem, excuse me.

00:01:39.657 --> 00:01:40.929
- I think if we keep our
performance up then we're

00:01:40.929 --> 00:01:42.961
in for some pretty profitable
gains for next year.

00:01:42.961 --> 00:01:45.873
- (slow clapping) Bravo, bravo.

00:01:45.873 --> 00:01:48.973
- Jesus, Jesus, Mellie, not now, not now.

00:01:49.212 --> 00:01:51.253
(soulful music)

00:01:59.576 --> 00:02:00.698
- It's handled.

00:02:02.006 --> 00:02:03.297
- Thank you?

